    "spec": "Return 'timezone' derived from the locality/region via this fixed region-to-timezone table, as an IANA name: NSW->Australia/Sydney, VIC->Australia/Melbourne, QLD->Australia/Brisbane.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nReturn 'timezone' derived from the locality/region via this fixed region-to-timezone table, as an IANA name: NSW->Australia/Sydney, VIC->Australia/Melbourne, QLD->Australia/Brisbane.\n"
